1
00:00:06,070 --> 00:00:08,660
Well,that thing's clearly in the way.
這個顯然沒用

2
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,670
All right.

3
00:00:14,410 --> 00:00:15,900
Damn fridge!
死冰箱

4
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,970
-Hi,Joey. How you doing? -Great...
-喬伊，你好嗎？ -很好

5
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,210
roomie.
室友

6
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:25,080
-I guess we are roommates. -I know.
-我們現在的確是室友 -沒錯

7
00:00:25,320 --> 00:00:28,620
Now that you bring it up, our fridge is broken.
經你一提， 我們的冰箱壞了

8
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,150
We need a new one.
得買台新的

9
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:33,920
I checked and your half is $400. Thanks a lot.
我打聽過，你得出4百 感激不盡

10
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,370
I'm not paying for that.
我才不跟你分 

11
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:40,090
I'm just here while they fix my place.
我只住到我們那邊整理好

12
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:44,930
Look, Rach, my parents bought this fridge just after I was born. Okay?
瑞秋，這台冰箱是我出生之後 我父母買的

13
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:49,670
I have never had a problem with it. Then you show up and it breaks!
我用都沒問題 你一來它就壞了

14
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:53,770
What does that tell you?
這意味著什麼？

15
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:57,580
That refrigerators don't live as long as people?
冰箱無法和人一樣長壽

16
00:00:59,890 --> 00:01:03,290
You know the ATM only lets you take out 300, so...
好，你也知道自動提款機 一次只能提3百

17
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:06,320
I'll take a check for the rest.
剩下的1百我就收支票

18
00:01:06,530 --> 00:01:08,020
You're joking, right?
你在開玩笑吧？

19
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:12,570
Of course I'm joking. I don't take checks.
那當然，我不收支票

20
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:16,570
Thank God, you're pretty.
幸好你很帥

21
00:01:20,110 --> 00:01:22,200
The One With Joey's Fridge
本集播出：「羅斯的煩惱」

00:01:24,110 --> 00:01:25,200
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

22
00:01:59,310 --> 00:02:02,220
Hi! Do you guys know any cute guys?
你們有認識的帥哥嗎？

23
00:02:02,420 --> 00:02:05,390
Of course. My good friend Joey over here.
當然有 就是我的好朋友喬伊

24
00:02:09,260 --> 00:02:11,950
I'm sorry. Thank you, Chandler.
我忘了…謝謝你

25
00:02:14,030 --> 00:02:17,260
There's a charity ball and Ralph Lauren has a table...
週末有大型慈善晚會 羅夫羅蘭買了一桌

26
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:18,590
so I have to go.
我也得去

27
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:20,930
-What charity? -I don't know.
為什麼兌款？ 不曉得

28
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:24,630
Something,either trees or disease...
不是某種樹就是某種病…

29
00:02:25,310 --> 00:02:26,900
Ralph mumbles a lot.
羅夫很會碎碎念

30
00:02:27,910 --> 00:02:31,970
-He mumbles when you're not attentive? -Yeah. It's weird.
-羅夫都趁你不專心時碎碎念嗎 -對呀，好奇怪

32
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:35,150
But I need to find a date.
總之我得找個男伴

33
00:02:35,350 --> 00:02:36,870
What kind of date?
你想找什麼樣的人？

34
00:02:37,090 --> 00:02:40,920
Someone that has his own tux or the ability to rent a tux.
自己有晚禮服或租得起晚禮服

35
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:43,990
So he has to be a male who has at least $50.
所以身家起碼要有50元

36
00:02:44,890 --> 00:02:46,120
So close.
只差一點

37
00:02:47,730 --> 00:02:49,530
-Hey,everybody! -Hi,there.
大家好

38
00:02:49,830 --> 00:02:52,390
-This is Elizabeth. -Hi,Elizabeth.
這是伊麗莎白

39
00:02:52,730 --> 00:02:54,460
I'm the student.
我就是那個學生

40
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:57,230
Isn't she cute? Nope.
真可愛…才怪

41
00:02:59,170 --> 00:03:02,230
Weren't you guys supposed to...
也許我不該多嘴 

42
00:03:02,440 --> 00:03:04,500
not be seen together?
但你們在一起不是不能被看到

43
00:03:04,780 --> 00:03:05,770
We aren't.
我們沒有在一起

44
00:03:05,980 --> 00:03:10,040
We just happen to have run into each other here.
沒有，我們只是兩個 在咖啡館巧遇的人

45
00:03:10,250 --> 00:03:11,740
This is...

46
00:03:13,190 --> 00:03:15,660
Oh,sly!
真奸詐

47
00:03:16,520 --> 00:03:19,120
I wanted to meet you guys, but I have to run.
我很想多認識你們 但是我得走了

48
00:03:19,330 --> 00:03:20,760
-See you later? -Okay.
改天見 好

49
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,730
-Bye, Ross. -Bye. See you.
-羅斯再見 -再見

50
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:27,070
-Didn't mean to run into you,sir. -That's quite all right,ma'am.
老師，我不是故意撞到你的 沒關係

51
00:03:27,270 --> 00:03:28,670
Bye.

52
00:03:29,140 --> 00:03:33,010
Why is she leaving? Is it a school night and she has homework?
她為什麼要走？ 剛放學功課一大堆？

53
00:03:33,510 --> 00:03:37,570
Yes. Her molecular epidemiology paper is due tomorrow.
對，她明天要交 分子流行病學報告

54
00:03:38,250 --> 00:03:40,440
Tell her good luck with that.
幫我祝她好運

55
00:03:41,280 --> 00:03:43,340
Anyone else? Bring them on.
還有嗎？別客氣

56
00:03:44,120 --> 00:03:47,210
-When's her birthday? -I don't know. Why?
她什麼時候生日？ 我不知道，怎麼了？

58
00:03:47,490 --> 00:03:51,620
It's just been so long since I've been to Chuck E. Cheese.
我好久沒吃兒童生日餐了

59
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:55,490
-I like Elizabeth. -Well,thanks.
我喜歡伊麗莎白 謝謝

60
00:03:55,700 --> 00:04:00,190
I like her so much, tell her I want my cookies early this year.
我真的很喜歡她 叫她今年早點送女童子軍餅乾來

61
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:04,040
A box of Thin Mints and some Tagalongs.
我要薄荷巧克力餅和巧克力派

62
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:07,830
Give him a break. Ross, how's it going with her?
你們別鬧他了 說真的，你們交往得怎樣？

63
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:09,410
It's been great.
非常好

64
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:14,610
She's 20, so she's not too serious, which is perfect for me now.
她才20歲，還不想太認真 最適合現在的我

65
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:17,820
That's great. Seriously, she seems nice.
太好了，她真的好像很不錯

66
00:04:18,090 --> 00:04:20,950
I know you guys like to give me a hard time...
謝謝，我知道你們喜歡臭我 

67
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,710
but it means a lot to me.
但我真的很希望你們能喜歡她

68
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,760
-Just knowing.. -Okay,I got a good one.
只要知道你們… 我想到一個很棒的

70
00:04:28,560 --> 00:04:30,620
What is she,like,12?
好，她是才12歲嗎？

71
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:43,710
Chandler, do we talk about our relationship enough?
錢德，你覺得我們的溝通夠嗎

72
00:04:44,210 --> 00:04:46,650
Yeah. Do we have any Fruit Roll-Ups?
夠，有水果卷嗎？

73
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,080
Okay.

74
00:04:50,290 --> 00:04:53,120
I thought of the perfect guy for Rachel to take to her thing.
我剛想到一個人 很適合當瑞秋的男伴

75
00:04:53,320 --> 00:04:55,290
That's so funny. We found someone too.
有意思，我們也找到人了

76
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:59,420
Good. She'll have a choice between my guy and your weirdo.
那好，她可以在我的人 和你們的怪胎之中選一個

77
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:03,950
-Why would our guy be a weirdo? -Because that's just your taste.
-為什麼我們的人是怪胎？ -你們的品味就是那樣

78
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:08,260
See, Rachel's not gonna pick your stupid guy.
瑞秋才不會選你的蠢人

79
00:05:08,470 --> 00:05:09,490
-Yeah? -Yeah.
是嗎？ 沒錯

80
00:05:09,670 --> 00:05:12,700
My guy is a lawyer, who does volunteer work.
我這個是律師，還當義工

81
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:15,310
And he has one of these.
而且他有這個東西

82
00:05:17,010 --> 00:05:18,950
A face ass?
臉屁股？

83
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,610
A chin dimple.
下巴窩啦

84
00:05:21,020 --> 00:05:23,040
Well,you know,our guy works with Chandler.
我們這個是錢德的同事 

85
00:05:23,250 --> 00:05:26,310
He's really nice and smart, and he's a great dresser.
人好聰明又會打扮

86
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:30,780
-Have you seen your guy's body? -No. Our guy's just a floating head.
你們看過他的身體嗎？ 沒有，他是一顆飄來飄去的頭

88
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:35,630
Well,my guy is spectacular. He's a massage client.
我這個身材很贊 他是我的客人

89
00:05:35,830 --> 00:05:40,560
And one time, when he was on the table, I looked at it. And I mean all of it.
有一次他在按摩台上 就被我看光光了

90
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,100
-You're not supposed to look. -Like there are police for that.
你不能偷看 警察又不會抓

91
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:48,500
You look? You massaged me.
你會偷看？我給你按摩過 

92
00:05:48,710 --> 00:05:50,510
I know.
沒錯

93
00:05:52,150 --> 00:05:56,520
Fine. Your guy may have a great body, but our guy is really funny.
好，你那個或許身材很好 但我們這個很風趣

94
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:58,810
Chandler funny?
錢德式的風趣？

95
00:05:59,420 --> 00:06:01,680
-Our guy's a great dancer. -My guy's well-read.
我們這個舞功高強 我這個飽讀詩書

96
00:06:01,960 --> 00:06:04,190
-Our guy has great hair. -My guy has great teeth.
我們這個髮質很好 我這個牙齒漂亮

97
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:06,760
Our guy smells incredible.
我們這個香得不得了

98
00:06:08,100 --> 00:06:11,030
Do you want our guy to be your guy?
你真這麼哈他？

99
00:06:19,740 --> 00:06:22,440
Well,you don't look good, Joe.
你的臉色不太好

100
00:06:23,780 --> 00:06:26,870
The fridge broke, so I had to eat everything.
冰箱壞了，我得把東西都吃掉

101
00:06:28,020 --> 00:06:30,280
Cold cuts, ice cream, limes.
冷盤、冰淇淋、萊姆…

102
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,410
What was in that brown jar?
咖啡色罐子裡是什麼？

103
00:06:33,620 --> 00:06:36,920
-That's still in there? -Not anymore.
那個還在？ 現在不在了

104
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:40,020
So anyway,how do you want to pay me?
總之你要怎麼付錢給我？

105
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:45,230
Is this a service you're providing me?
你要提供某種服務嗎？

106
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:49,470
No,for my new fridge. For our new fridge.
不是，是我要買冰箱 我們要買冰箱

107
00:06:49,770 --> 00:06:51,200
Our new fridge?
我們？

108
00:06:51,410 --> 00:06:53,770
-I don't live here anymore. -So what?
我已經不住這裡了 那又怎樣？ 

109
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:57,380
Look,okay,suppose we were a divorced couple.
假設我們是離婚夫妻

110
00:06:57,880 --> 00:07:00,370
And I got custody of the kid. Right?
我取得孩子的監護權

111
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:04,610
Now suppose the kid dies and I gotta buy a new kid.
結果孩子死了 我總得買個新孩子

112
00:07:07,890 --> 00:07:09,360
Okay.
好

113
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:12,480
Give me $400!
給我4百元

114
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:16,320
Thank God, you're pretty.
幸好你很帥

115
00:07:24,340 --> 00:07:25,810
Professor Geller?
蓋勒教授

116
00:07:26,410 --> 00:07:28,400
Oh,a student I don't know.
一名我不認識的學生

117
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:33,540
I was wondering if I could talk to you for a moment?
能不能跟您談一下？

118
00:07:33,750 --> 00:07:36,240
Yes,of course. What would this be regarding?
當然可以，是哪方面的事？

119
00:07:36,450 --> 00:07:38,980
Making out in your office.
在你的研究室親熱

120
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:43,720
Of course. Why don't we go inside.
好，我們進去再說

121
00:07:51,770 --> 00:07:53,830
-What? -Doorknob.
怎麼了？ 門把

122
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,470
Sorry.
抱歉

123
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:58,370
I actually do need to talk to you.
我真的有事要講 

124
00:07:58,570 --> 00:07:59,560
What about?
好，什麼事？

125
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:02,210
-Spring vacation? -Spring vacation?
-春假的事 -春假的事？

126
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:05,780
Yeah, we have time off, and a lot of people are going on trips..
對，學校沒課 很多人要去旅行…

127
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:10,040
-Professor Geller. -Yes,Professor Friesenstinlender.
-蓋勒教授 -是，菲森死盯個樂教授…

128
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:13,280
I'll be with you in one moment.
我馬上就好

129
00:08:13,490 --> 00:08:17,360
So I will take one box of the Thin Mints.
那我就買一盒薄荷巧克力餅

130
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:26,700
You don't understand. Elizabeth was about to ask me to go on a trip with her.
你們不懂 伊麗莎白想找我跟她去旅行

131
00:08:26,900 --> 00:08:29,560
Is that taking it slow? I'm not ready for this.
這樣叫慢慢來嗎？ 我還沒準備好

132
00:08:29,770 --> 00:08:33,000
-What do I tell her? -Tell her the truth,tell her you're not ready.
-我該怎麼說？ -實話實說，說你還沒準備好

134
00:08:34,380 --> 00:08:35,840
I could do that.
可以試試

135
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:41,780
-What if she gets upset? -Then you distract her with a Barbie doll.
要是她不高興呢？ 你就拿芭比娃娃逗她

136
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:46,250
Or you could just, you know, you...
或者你也可以…

137
00:08:52,260 --> 00:08:54,850
What the hell are you doing?
你幹什麼？

138
00:08:55,930 --> 00:09:00,370
What the hell am I doing? You just broke my fridge!
我幹什麼？你弄壞我的冰箱

139
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:02,600
What? How do..?
什麼？你怎麼...

140
00:09:02,800 --> 00:09:04,770
How do you know it's even broken?
你怎麼知道它壞了？

141
00:09:05,310 --> 00:09:08,500
You think I don't know what breaks my fridge?
它怎麼壞的我會不知道嗎？

142
00:09:09,140 --> 00:09:10,770
Excuse me!
你等一下

143
00:09:11,710 --> 00:09:13,510
Well,what do you know?
看吧

144
00:09:13,710 --> 00:09:14,980
Broken!
壞了

145
00:09:15,850 --> 00:09:17,720
That'll be $400.
請賠4百

146
00:09:18,420 --> 00:09:20,850
Joey, I saw you push him.
喬伊，我看見你推他了

147
00:09:23,460 --> 00:09:24,860
You pushed him.
是你推的

148
00:09:27,300 --> 00:09:31,790
Joey,I did not break this. Okay? That has been broken for a while.
喬伊，我沒把它弄壞 它已經壞一陣子了

149
00:09:35,040 --> 00:09:37,330
Remember I told you about our fridge?
我不是提過我們的冰箱的事？

150
00:09:37,540 --> 00:09:40,970
I still haven't gotten the check for your half yet.
我還沒拿到你該出的錢

151
00:09:41,640 --> 00:09:43,230
Do not give him any money!
不要給他錢 

152
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:47,280
I'm not talking to you! You broke my fridge!
你少插嘴，你撞壞我的冰箱

153
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:59,290
-You wanted to see me,Professor Geller? -Yes. Please come in.
-蓋勒教授，你找我？ -是的，請進

154
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:07,170
-Doorknob? -Yeah. It kind of grows on you.
-門把？ -對，你有點玩上癮了

155
00:10:08,500 --> 00:10:11,770
I wanted to finish talking to you about spring vacation.
我想繼續上次春假的話題 

156
00:10:11,970 --> 00:10:13,340
Good.
好

157
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:16,970
Look,I...
聽我說，我…

158
00:10:21,620 --> 00:10:24,180
Look,I'm having a great time with you.
我跟你在一起很開心

159
00:10:24,390 --> 00:10:29,690
And I just don't want us to move too fast or put too much pressure on us.
我不想進展得太快 或是給我們太多壓力

160
00:10:30,160 --> 00:10:33,150
So I'm sorry, I just don't think we should go away together yet.
所以很抱歉 我們還不能一起旅行

161
00:10:33,360 --> 00:10:34,760
It's too soon.
太快了

162
00:10:35,330 --> 00:10:38,420
Ross,I think you misunderstood what I was saying.
羅斯，你誤會我的意思了

163
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:44,730
I just wanted to tell you that I'm going to Florida for a couple weeks.
我只是想告訴你 我要去佛羅里達2星期

164
00:10:47,380 --> 00:10:49,470
No.
不

165
00:10:49,680 --> 00:10:53,370
I think you misunderstood what I was saying.
是你誤會我的意思了

166
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,510
What I meant was..
我的意思是… 

167
00:10:55,720 --> 00:10:57,010
You are so adorable.
你好可愛

168
00:10:57,220 --> 00:11:00,190
That. Let's talk about that.
這個，我們來討論這個

169
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,060
-Hi. -Hi.

170
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,890
How did it go with Elizabeth?
你跟伊麗莎白談得怎樣？

171
00:11:07,230 --> 00:11:11,460
Fine. Just a misunderstanding. She didn't want me to go with her.
沒事，只是一場誤會 她沒有要找我去 

172
00:11:11,670 --> 00:11:15,260
She just wanted to let me know she's going to Florida for a spring vacation.
她只是要告訴我她要去放春假

173
00:11:15,470 --> 00:11:18,730
Wait a minute. Is she going for spring vacation or spring break? Wahoo!
等等，她是去放春假 還是去春遊？

174
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:22,700
What's the difference?
有什麼差別？

175
00:11:23,040 --> 00:11:26,140
Spring vacation, you're doing nice things with your grandparents.
春假是跟爺爺奶奶共享天倫

176
00:11:26,350 --> 00:11:29,010
Spring break, you're doing frat guys.
春遊是跟兄弟會的人上床

177
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:33,810
You know what? Not all spring breaks are like that.
並非每個人的春遊都那樣

178
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:37,010
-What did you do on yours? -I went to Egypt with my dad.
你做了什麼？ 我跟我爸去埃及

179
00:11:38,990 --> 00:11:43,520
I can see it now. "Look, Dad, it's the Sphinx,wahoo!"
我可以想像 「爸，是人面獅身像」

180
00:11:44,370 --> 00:11:49,130
I think Elizabeth is a little more serious than: "Spring break,wahoo!"
伊麗莎白那麼正經 不會去「春遊」

181
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:51,860
Come on, she's taking my class.
好嗎？她修了我的課

182
00:11:52,070 --> 00:11:55,340
-And slept with the professor. -I'm gonna call her.
-還跟教授上床 -我去打給她

183
00:11:58,950 --> 00:12:02,010
You guys, I want you to meet Sebastian.
各位，這是賽巴斯欽

184
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:08,280
We met at the newsstand. We both grabbed for the last Field and Stream.
我們剛剛在報攤認識 我們都買了「原野與河流」

185
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:10,950
What? I read that.
我有在看啊

186
00:12:12,030 --> 00:12:15,620
-Can I get you a cup of coffee? -Yes. Thank you.
你要咖啡嗎？ 要，謝謝

187
00:12:18,270 --> 00:12:21,460
-Rachel, what the hell is this? -What?
瑞秋，你這是什麼意思？

188
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:25,570
You ask us to find a guy, and you come traipsing in here with a guy of your own?
什麼？ 你叫我們幫你找人 卻自己帶了個人來

190
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:26,860
You found me a guy?
你們幫我找到人了？

191
00:12:27,070 --> 00:12:30,700
Yes. We found you a really cute, funny guy from Chandler's work.
對，我們在錢德的公司 相中一個可愛風趣的人

192
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:34,310
Yeah,and I found you one too, who is not a weirdo.
我也找了一個不是怪胎的人

193
00:12:35,780 --> 00:12:39,340
You know what though, guys, I really appreciate that...
你們知道嗎？真是謝謝你們 

194
00:12:39,550 --> 00:12:41,280
but I'm gonna take Sebastian.
不過我帶賽巴斯欽去就好了

195
00:12:41,490 --> 00:12:44,390
Are you sure? Our guy smells incredible.
你確定？我們這個很香喔

196
00:12:44,590 --> 00:12:47,030
Would you stop it with that already?
別再提那個了好嗎？

197
00:12:47,530 --> 00:12:50,120
-Here you go. -Thank you.
-你的咖啡 -謝謝

198
00:12:51,170 --> 00:12:54,330
So, Sebastian, do you do any volunteer work?
賽巴斯欽，你有在當義工嗎？

199
00:12:54,800 --> 00:12:56,830
-Not really. Why? -No reason.
沒有，怎麼了？

200
00:12:57,040 --> 00:13:00,300
I know a single guy who does care about other people.
沒事，我只是認識一個 關心別人的單身漢

201
00:13:01,640 --> 00:13:02,970
Are you funny?
你風趣嗎？

202
00:13:04,350 --> 00:13:06,750
-Excuse me? -What are you guys doing?
-什麼？ -你們在幹什麼？

203
00:13:07,150 --> 00:13:09,310
Are you funny? Tell us a joke!
你風趣嗎？講個笑話來聽

204
00:13:10,820 --> 00:13:13,120
I just wanted to have coffee with Rachel.
我只是想和瑞秋喝杯咖啡

205
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:15,580
Well,so do a lot of people.
很多人都想

206
00:13:17,020 --> 00:13:19,520
-Actually,I gotta get going. -But you..
說實話我該走了

207
00:13:20,130 --> 00:13:23,120
-Give me a call sometime. -You didn't give me your phone number.
-有空打電話給我 -你沒給我電話號碼

208
00:13:23,330 --> 00:13:24,990
Okay,see you later.
好，那就改天見

209
00:13:26,530 --> 00:13:29,530
Turns out he is kind of funny.
原來他蠻風趣的

210
00:13:30,700 --> 00:13:32,700
I cannot believe you guys!
你們真是太扯了 

211
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:35,930
He was really nice, and he just left because of you!
他人很好，卻被你們趕走了

212
00:13:36,380 --> 00:13:39,180
Yeah, but "Sebastian"? What is that, a cat's name?
賽巴斯欽耶？ 那是貓的名字嗎？

213
00:13:40,550 --> 00:13:44,210
You know what I noticed, Rachel? He scares easy.
你知道我發現什麼？ 他很容易被嚇到

214
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:46,720
Is that the kind of guy you wanna take to a ball?
你想帶這種人參加舞會嗎？

215
00:13:46,920 --> 00:13:48,890
"Hey,Sebastian, would you like to dance?"
「賽巴斯欽，要不要跳舞？」

216
00:13:49,390 --> 00:13:50,880
"Okay. I gotta go."
「好，我得走了」

217
00:13:52,430 --> 00:13:54,760
Stop it. Rachel,we're very sorry.
別再說了 瑞秋，對不起

218
00:13:54,960 --> 00:13:57,620
That is a very insensitive thing to do.
我們太過份了

219
00:13:57,870 --> 00:14:01,130
Let us make it up to you. We have two really great guys for you.
這樣吧，讓我們補償你 我們有兩個好男人讓你挑

220
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:03,090
Yeah, what have you got to lose?
對啊，你有什麼損失？ 

221
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:08,240
You might even end up with someone really special. If you pick my guy.
搞不好會認識讓你心動的人 如果你選我這邊的話

223
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:11,300
-All right. -So you will meet our guys?
好吧 你願意見我們找的人？

225
00:14:11,510 --> 00:14:12,540
Yes.
我願意

226
00:14:13,010 --> 00:14:15,610
It doesn't matter which one you choose. It's up to you.
你要選誰都行，由你自己決定

227
00:14:15,820 --> 00:14:17,780
Our guy is perfect.
我們這個很完美

228
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:23,120
Or you could go out with the guy Phoebe deemed not good enough for herself.
或者你也可以選 菲比自己看不上眼的人

229
00:14:23,820 --> 00:14:26,120
There you are! You broke my fridge.
菲比，你在這裡 你弄壞我的冰箱

230
00:14:26,330 --> 00:14:27,790
You owe me $400.
欠我4百

231
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:31,260
-Okay,sure. -Really?
好吧 真的？

232
00:14:32,770 --> 00:14:36,670
Technically,you owe me $600 for sending out happy thoughts...
技術上來說你欠我6百 

233
00:14:36,870 --> 00:14:39,840
on your last 10 auditions.
你最近十次試鏡我都有祝禱

234
00:14:43,540 --> 00:14:44,880
Call it even?
那就扯平了？

235
00:14:46,650 --> 00:14:48,310
Okay.
好吧

236
00:14:50,480 --> 00:14:51,710
There you are.
回來了

237
00:14:51,990 --> 00:14:53,420
What did Elizabeth say?
伊麗莎白怎麼說？

238
00:14:53,920 --> 00:14:58,120
Turns out she is going to Daytona for "spring break,wahoo."
她真的是要去德通納春遊

239
00:14:58,330 --> 00:15:03,090
That means wet T-shirt contests, guys doing shots off of girls' bodies...
也就是有濕T恤美女選拔賽 男生朝女生身上扔水球

240
00:15:03,300 --> 00:15:04,390
waking up with strangers.
在陌生人身邊醒來

241
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:06,930
She is gonna have a great time!
她會玩得很爽

242
00:15:08,970 --> 00:15:11,300
Is she staying at the Hotel Corona?
她要住可樂娜飯店嗎？

243
00:15:12,010 --> 00:15:15,870
-You know the hotels? -I was there! Spring Break '81,wahoo!
-你熟那裡的飯店？ -當然，我參加過81年春遊

244
00:15:16,080 --> 00:15:18,770
In 1981,you were 13.
81年你才13歲

245
00:15:19,310 --> 00:15:22,250
So? I drove down, sold T-shirts. Had a blast.
那又怎樣？我開車去賣T恤 玩得好開心

246
00:15:22,450 --> 00:15:26,350
You know who knows how to party? Drunk college chicks.
你們知道誰最會瘋？ 酒醉的大學女生

247
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:30,480
Okay,she can't go.
好，她不准去

248
00:15:31,190 --> 00:15:33,920
You can't tell her not to go. You just started dating.
羅斯，你不能叫她不要去 你們才交往沒多久

249
00:15:34,160 --> 00:15:37,150
-What am I supposed to do? -You just have to be cool with it.
-那我該怎麼辦？ -不怎麼辦，你只能接受

251
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:40,230
What if she goes down there and sleeps with a bunch of guys?
要是她跑去跟一堆人上床呢？

252
00:15:40,670 --> 00:15:43,160
Well, maybe you don't marry this one.
那這次你就別娶她

253
00:15:47,710 --> 00:15:50,680
I'm sorry, this is very serious. And you know what,Ross?
對不起，這是很嚴肅的事 你知道嗎？

254
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:54,680
You like her, she likes you, everything's gonna be fine.
你喜歡她 她也喜歡你，不會有事的

255
00:15:54,850 --> 00:15:57,250
You're right. I'm probably overreacting.
你說得對，我反應過度了

256
00:15:57,420 --> 00:16:00,110
It's just she's staying at this party hotel on the beach...
她要住在濱海飯店 

257
00:16:00,290 --> 00:16:02,810
with a huge pool and free drinks with every meal.
有大游泳池，每頓都吃大餐…

258
00:16:02,990 --> 00:16:07,520
If she's got enough money for that, she can certainly pat for the fridge she broke.
她既然這麼有錢 一定能賠償她弄壞的冰箱

259
00:16:14,100 --> 00:16:16,590
I'm so glad you're going on this trip.
你能去旅行真是好事 

260
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:19,710
I've been working so hard this semester.
就是啊，我這學期那麼用功

261
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:22,400
I really need to go crazy, blow off some steam.
很需要瘋狂一下，緩解壓力 

262
00:16:22,610 --> 00:16:24,410
Sure.
當然

263
00:16:25,950 --> 00:16:29,940
Look,I don't know if your plans are finalized yet,but...
我不知道你的計劃已定了沒

264
00:16:30,520 --> 00:16:33,350
I know a great way to blow off steam.
還有一個辦法可以緩解壓力

265
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:36,420
-What? -Are you into crafts at all?
-什麼辦法？ -你喜歡做手工藝嗎？

266
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,590
Ross,are you okay?
羅斯，你還好嗎？

267
00:16:40,060 --> 00:16:41,890
Yeah. Of course I'm okay.
我當然很好 

268
00:16:42,100 --> 00:16:44,120
I'm just being supportive.
我只是在表示支持

269
00:16:44,330 --> 00:16:47,200
Supportive of you and this whole trip...
支持你和這次旅行 

270
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:50,270
and what's this?
還有這是什麼？

271
00:16:52,370 --> 00:16:53,740
It's a bathing suit?
那是泳衣 

272
00:16:54,170 --> 00:16:56,070
To wear in front of people?
你要穿它去見人？

273
00:16:57,380 --> 00:16:58,640
Is that supportive?
這樣叫支持嗎？ 

274
00:16:58,850 --> 00:17:01,110
Is this?
這樣是嗎？

275
00:17:03,080 --> 00:17:04,310
Okay,good.
太好了

276
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:05,470
-Hey. -Hi.

277
00:17:05,690 --> 00:17:09,650
We're so glad you decided to meet our guy. You'll like him so much.
很高興你答應見我們找的人 你一定會很喜歡他

278
00:17:09,890 --> 00:17:12,690
-When do you want to meet him? -I don't know.
-你要什麼時候見他？ -不曉得 

279
00:17:12,890 --> 00:17:15,760
-I don't work late tomorrow night. -Tomorrow night is good.
-我知道我明天不用加班 -明天不錯…

281
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:20,560
But why put off something till tomorrow that you could do it right now?
不過現在能做的事 為什麼要拖到明天？

282
00:17:20,770 --> 00:17:23,070
-Eldad,come here! -What?
艾達，過來

283
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:25,940
-This is Rachel. -How are you?
艾達，這位是瑞秋 你好嗎？

284
00:17:26,140 --> 00:17:28,570
A little blindsided but good.
有點措手不及，不過我很好

285
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:32,510
Eldad,sit down. Move over now.
艾達，坐…你坐過去

286
00:17:33,410 --> 00:17:35,510
There you go. There you are.
這就對了

287
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:39,280
Okay,we can take a hint!
好，我們知道了

288
00:17:40,150 --> 00:17:42,380
What? What are you doing here?
你來幹什麼？ 

289
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:43,780
This is Patrick.
這位是派屈克

290
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:44,950
-Hi. -Hi.

291
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,720
You're too late because she's already with our guy.
你來晚了 她跟我們那個在一起了

292
00:17:47,930 --> 00:17:52,300
You're right,I am too late. They're sitting on the couch and talking.
天哪，我是來晚了 他們正坐在沙發上聊天

293
00:17:52,970 --> 00:17:54,590
Come on.

294
00:17:55,870 --> 00:17:57,840
Rachel? This is Patrick.
瑞秋 怎樣？ 這是派屈克

296
00:17:58,940 --> 00:17:59,960
-Hi. -Hi.

297
00:18:00,140 --> 00:18:02,010
This is the guy I was telling you about.
他就是我說的那個人

298
00:18:02,210 --> 00:18:06,150
This suit does not do justice to what's underneath it.
相信我，這套西裝 太委屈底下的身材了

299
00:18:07,210 --> 00:18:08,440
Okay.
好

300
00:18:08,780 --> 00:18:12,720
But, Phoebe, I'm just sort of in the middle of something.
但是 菲比 我現在有點事

302
00:18:13,490 --> 00:18:15,510
Okay. That's okay. Have a seat.
好，沒關係，你坐

303
00:18:16,560 --> 00:18:18,620
-You can't do that! -I should go.
你不能這樣 我走好了 

304
00:18:18,830 --> 00:18:20,850
Sit down, we're winning.
坐下，我們佔上風

305
00:18:22,130 --> 00:18:23,650
Maybe I should go.
也許我才應該走 

306
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:25,800
No. Have a seat!
不要，坐下

307
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:28,700
Rachel, you haven't touched Eldad's hair.
瑞秋，你還沒摸過艾達的頭髮

308
00:18:29,140 --> 00:18:31,970
-He has the softest hair. Touch it. -I'm good.
超柔順的，你摸摸看 不必了

309
00:18:32,170 --> 00:18:36,610
Rachel, Patrick is really rich. Give her some money.
瑞秋，派屈克很有錢 拿錢給她

310
00:18:38,410 --> 00:18:40,810
This isn't really worth the free massage.
這個免費按摩的代價太高了

311
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:43,040
-That's right. Bye-bye. -No.
沒錯，派屈克，再見

312
00:18:43,250 --> 00:18:46,340
Eldad is much more cooperative, and he can dance.
艾達合作多了，而且很會跳舞

313
00:18:46,550 --> 00:18:48,150
You dance for Rachel.
你跳舞給瑞秋看

314
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:50,550
Don't dance for me. Please!
不，拜託不要

315
00:18:51,190 --> 00:18:53,160
What is the matter with you?
你們是怎麼搞的？

316
00:18:53,490 --> 00:18:55,430
Yeah, let's talk it out.
沒錯，大家來說清楚 我…

317
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:59,030
Am I the only one that this is embarrassing for?
只有我覺得尷尬嗎？

318
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:01,060
I'm a little embarrassed.
我也有點尷尬

319
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:07,440
I'll tell you who should be embarrassed. It's you guys.
該尷尬的是你們 這實在是太扯了

320
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:10,040
I do not need you to get me a date.
很謝謝你們 但我不需要你們幫我找人

321
00:19:10,240 --> 00:19:13,010
-Why did she ask us to..? -I am still talking!
-那你為什麼叫我們… -我還沒說完

322
00:19:13,210 --> 00:19:16,010
Then you chase away the one guy I actually liked.
你們還把我真正喜歡的人趕走

323
00:19:16,220 --> 00:19:19,780
No offense to you guys. Really, congratulations on...
我沒有冒犯的意思，真的 恭喜你...

324
00:19:20,020 --> 00:19:22,010
all the cash.
有那麼多現金

325
00:19:22,290 --> 00:19:25,350
And you really do have very soft hair.
還有你…你的頭髮真的很柔順

326
00:19:25,560 --> 00:19:30,660
But I'd much rather go to the ball by myself than go through any more of this.
但我寧可自己參加晚會 也不要再受這種氣

327
00:19:30,860 --> 00:19:32,090
Goodbye.
再見

328
00:19:34,430 --> 00:19:38,000
Now,do you use some sort of special conditioner on that hair?
你有用什麼特別的潤發乳嗎？

329
00:19:38,210 --> 00:19:39,430
Papaya extract.
有，木瓜粹取液 

330
00:19:39,640 --> 00:19:40,870
Thank you.
謝謝

331
00:19:46,250 --> 00:19:49,010
So have a great time down there.
好好去玩吧 

332
00:19:49,180 --> 00:19:50,170
-I will. -Yeah.
我會的

333
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:53,190
-Did you pack that bathing suit? -Yeah.
你有帶那套泳衣嗎？ 有

334
00:19:53,390 --> 00:19:57,020
It was pretty funny when I hid it for a while.
我剛才把它藏起來 實在蠻好笑的

335
00:19:59,890 --> 00:20:01,450
Anyway.
總之…

336
00:20:02,600 --> 00:20:04,830
I am worried about that suit.
我不是擔心那套泳裝太曝露 

337
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:08,000
Not because it's revealing, which I'm fine with.
這一點我不在意

338
00:20:08,200 --> 00:20:10,400
I'm concerned about your health.
我是關心你的健康

339
00:20:11,810 --> 00:20:13,170
Sun exposure.
怕你曬到

340
00:20:13,370 --> 00:20:15,670
Don't worry,I have plenty of sun block.
放心，我帶了一大堆防曬油 

341
00:20:15,880 --> 00:20:17,610
-It's SPF 30. -All right.
防曬係數30

342
00:20:17,810 --> 00:20:20,840
Well, if what's in the bottle is actually 30.
如果真的有30就好了

343
